    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d566">

                <pb facs="0764" n="670" xml:id="pg670"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Brice to Mr.
                            Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Matanzas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic">January 15, 1897</hi></date>.
                        (Received January 21.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 76.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report the following,
                    viz:</p>
                <p>Oscar Cespedes, American citizen confined in prison since last September in
                    Matanzas, has been transferred to Habana January 11, 1897. I visited him
                    frequently while here, and the encouragement given him has very materially
                    improved his health. I sincerely trust he will soon be released.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. C. Brice</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
